        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jean-Claude Andro, Georges Bernanos, Lucy Maud Montgomery\n- Works: Christ des ténèbres, Anne of Green Gables\n- Places: Avonlea\n\nFacts:\n- In 1976, Jean-Claude Andro translated the book \"Christ des ténèbres.\"\n- Georges Bernanos wrote \"Christ des ténèbres.\"\n- Lucy Maud Montgomery wrote \"Anne of Green Gables.\"\n- The fictional community of Avonlea is the setting of \"Anne of Green Gables.\"\n- Georges Bernanos and Lucy Maud Montgomery were both authors.",
